@baseUrl = http://localhost:5063
@providerId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@versionId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@organizationId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@projectId = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444
@csrfToken = replace-with-your-session-csrf-token

### Use your session cookie jar and X-CSRF-Token; publication requires a recent-MFA operator.
POST {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/providers/{{providerId}}/data-policies
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "retention": "Unknown",
  "training": "Unknown",
  "residency": "Unknown",
  "regions": [],
  "scope": "Synthetic API documentation example only",
  "conditions": "No verified provider policy is asserted by this example.",
  "sourceUrl": "https://example.com/provider-policy",
  "sourceObservedAt": "2026-10-17T00:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Document an unverified policy observation"
}

### Bounded operator history
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/providers/{{providerId}}/data-policies?limit=50

### Exact immutable version (unknown ID returns 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/provider-data-policies/{{versionId}}

### Session-authenticated tenant/project read; absence of publication returns explicit Unknown
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/projects/{{projectId}}/catalog/providers/openai/data-policy
